---
/**
 * Variant 2: Modern Isomorphic Glass Design
 * Futuristic yet warm, human, sterile but approachable
 * Glass morphism, soft gradients, positive future aesthetic
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Variante 20 - Modern Glass Gold | Mobile Kinderosteopathie Leipzig</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-primary: #f59e0b;
      --color-primary-light: #22d3ee;
      --color-primary-dark: #0e7490;
      --color-accent: #d97706;
      --color-accent-soft: #c4b5fd;
      --color-text: #1e293b;
      --color-text-muted: #64748b;
      --color-text-light: #94a3b8;
      --color-background: #f8fafc;
      --color-white: #ffffff;
      --font-main: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;

      /* Glass effect colors */
      --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      --glass-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      color: var(--color-text);
      background: var(--color-background);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Mesh gradient background */
    .mesh-gradient {
      background:
        radial-gradient(at 40% 20%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 80% 0%, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.12) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 0% 50%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 80% 50%, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.1) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 0% 100%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, #f1f5f9 100%);
    }

    /* Glass card effect */
    .glass {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      box-shadow:
        0 4px 6px -1px var(--glass-shadow),
        0 2px 4px -2px var(--glass-shadow);
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      padding: 16px 0;
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-glass {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      color: var(--color-text);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    }

    .btn-glass:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 120px 0 80px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
      color: var(--color-primary);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    }

    .hero-badge::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.2); }
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .hero h1 .highlight {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      max-width: 500px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-card {
      padding: 48px;
      border-radius: 32px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-image {
      aspect-ratio: 4/5;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Floating elements */
    .float-element {
      position: absolute;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .float-1 {
      top: 10%;
      right: -10%;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.9);
      color: white;
      animation-delay: 0s;
    }

    .float-2 {
      bottom: 20%;
      left: -5%;
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      color: var(--color-text);
      animation-delay: -2s;
    }

    .float-3 {
      bottom: 5%;
      right: 5%;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.85);
      color: white;
      animation-delay: -4s;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
    }

    /* Stats Section */
    .stats-section {
      padding: 40px 0;
      margin-top: -40px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .stats-card {
      padding: 32px 48px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .stat-label {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* Features Section */
    .features-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }

    .section-label {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .section-header p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 40px 32px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .feature-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .feature-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .feature-icon svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* About Section */
    .about-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-image-wrapper {
      position: relative;
    }

    .about-image {
      aspect-ratio: 4/5;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .about-decoration {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      top: 24px;
      left: 24px;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      border-radius: 32px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .about-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .credentials-list {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .credential {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.1);
    }

    .credential-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .credential span {
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    /* CTA Section */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
    }

    .cta-card {
      padding: 80px;
      border-radius: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .cta-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -50%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .cta-card h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      position: relative;
    }

    .cta-card p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    .btn-white {
      background: white;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      padding: 16px 40px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .btn-white:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background: var(--color-text);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      padding: 64px 0 32px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .footer h4 {
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .footer-links {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .footer-links li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-primary-light);
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding-top: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    /* Back link */
    .back-link {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      z-index: 100;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.5);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
      .hero-visual { order: -1; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.75rem; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav { display: none; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
      .hero { padding: 100px 0 60px; min-height: auto; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
      .stats-card { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding: 32px 24px; }
      .cta-card { padding: 48px 24px; }
      .float-element { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="mesh-gradient">
  <a href="/project/designs" class="back-link">← Alle Varianten</a>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header-inner glass">
        <a href="#" class="logo">Susanne <span>Hoppe</span></a>
        <nav class="nav">
          <a href="#">Home</a>
          <a href="#">Über mich</a>
          <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
          <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Termin anfragen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-badge">
            Mobile Kinderosteopathie
          </div>
          <h1>
            Sanfte Behandlung<br>
            <span class="highlight">bei Ihnen zuhause</span>
          </h1>
          <p>
            Professionelle osteopathische Behandlung für Ihr Kind –
            in der vertrauten Atmosphäre Ihres Zuhauses.
            Entspannt, individuell und kindgerecht.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
              Termin vereinbaren
              <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-glass">Mehr erfahren</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <div class="hero-card glass">
            <div class="hero-image">
              Foto Susanne Hoppe
            </div>
            <div class="float-element float-1">20+ Jahre Erfahrung</div>
            <div class="float-element float-2">✓ Zertifiziert</div>
            <div class="float-element float-3">Leipzig & Umgebung</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats Section -->
  <section class="stats-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-card glass">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">20+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Jahre Erfahrung</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Hausbesuche</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">0-14</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Jahre Altersgruppe</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Vorteile</span>
        <h2>Warum mobile Kinderosteopathie?</h2>
        <p>Professionelle Behandlung mit dem Komfort Ihres Zuhauses kombiniert.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Behandlung zuhause</h3>
          <p>Ihr Kind wird in seiner vertrauten Umgebung behandelt – entspannter und ohne stressige Anfahrt für die ganze Familie.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Langjährige Expertise</h3>
          <p>Über 20 Jahre Erfahrung in der therapeutischen Arbeit mit Kindern – als Physiotherapeutin und Osteopathin.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card glass">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Kindgerechte Methoden</h3>
          <p>Sanfte osteopathische Techniken, speziell auf die Bedürfnisse von Säuglingen und Kindern abgestimmt.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image-wrapper">
          <div class="about-image">
            Foto Susanne Hoppe
          </div>
          <div class="about-decoration"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <span class="section-label">Über mich</span>
          <h2>Susanne Hoppe</h2>
          <p>
            Ich bin Physiotherapeutin und zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin
            mit über 20 Jahren Erfahrung in der Arbeit mit Kindern.
          </p>
          <p>
            Als mobile Osteopathin komme ich zu Ihnen nach Hause – damit Ihr Kind
            in seiner vertrauten Umgebung behandelt werden kann. Entspannt,
            ohne Wartezeiten und ohne stressige Anfahrt.
          </p>

          <div class="credentials-list">
            <div class="credential">
              <div class="credential-icon">✓</div>
              <span>Staatlich geprüfte Physiotherapeutin</span>
            </div>
            <div class="credential">
              <div class="credential-icon">✓</div>
              <span>Zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin</span>
            </div>
            <div class="credential">
              <div class="credential-icon">✓</div>
              <span>20+ Jahre Berufserfahrung</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 32px;">Mehr erfahren</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <h2>Bereit für einen Termin?</h2>
        <p>
          Ich freue mich darauf, Sie und Ihr Kind kennenzulernen.
          Kontaktieren Sie mich für ein unverbindliches Gespräch.
